			<tr><td><a href="img/wagatenn_3_052.jpg">
	<img height="283" src="img/wagatenn_3_052_small.jpg" width="378" /></a><a href="img/wagatenn_3_053.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/wagatenn_3_053_small.jpg" width="378" /></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">甲羅のにじみの除去、ツヤなしに。分割は目立たないように。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->
			<tr><th id="5">R0005. イシダイ♂(若齢個体) </th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/wagatenn_3_015.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/wagatenn_3_015_small.jpg" width="378" /></a><a href="img/wagatenn_3_016.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/wagatenn_3_016_small.jpg" width="378" /></a></td></tr>
